tweets.full_text:
@CryptoWithKris Kris breaks down the chart structure in the latest "Trading the Markets" episode.

Watch it for free on Real Vision youtube: https://t.co/25dcBwAZyQ

The healthiest charts in a bull market don't go vertical.

@CryptoWithKris on the structure he trusts: a slow grind up and to the right, regular pullbacks to the moving average, higher highs you can actually buy.

The Quant-style rips that put in 300% candles can hand back 50% just as fast.

Steady beats violent.
